        <head>BABY TODD'S CURE OF SORE EYES</head>
        <p>BABY TODD'S CURE OF SORE EYES</p>
        <p>Over Two Years of Awful Suffering— Eyes Stuck Together and Would Bleed When Washed Open in the Morning—Every Lash Fell Out.</p>
