      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1906-02-17_WidnesExaminer_art0123" n="art0123">
        <head>BEAMONT SCHOOL.</head>
        <p>THE BEAMONT SCHOOL.</p>
        <p>Laying of the Memorial Stone. ---- INTERESTING PROCEEDINGS.</p>
        <p>I</p>
      </div>
