        <p>• SNAKES INTERRUPT CRICKET MATCH. At the Antipodes .the snake season and the cricket season coincide. A recent Australian mail reports a match in Victoria in which the ball was hit into some undergrowth, The fielder Who went after it found the spot occupied by two big snakes, a .brown and a black one. The game was temporarily suspended, the reptiles were killed with cricket stumps, and, the ball was. recovered.</p>
